# GREENSPEAKER

{{note,large,classDetails
**Key Stats:** WIL, STR   **Hit Die:** 1d8  **Starting HP:** 13
:
**Saves:** WIL+, DEX-   **Armor:** Cloth   **Weapons:** Staves, Wands, Blades
:
**Starting Gear:** Adventurer’s Garb, Staff, Strange Plant
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 1
     ========================================================= -->

{{level

**Floral Weapon.** Learn the <i>Thorn Whip</i> cantrip.
:
**Seed Dice.** When you roll initiative and at the end of each of your turns, gain a d4 Seed Die, then grow all of your other Seed Dice by one. Your max Seed Die size is d8, and you can have a max of STR+1 Seed Dice.
:
**Chuck Seed.** (1/turn) Free action: Expend a Seed Die. Roll it and deal that much damage to a creature within Reach 6 (ignoring armor) 

}}

{{note,wide
**Seed Dice.** When you grow or decay a Seed Die, swap the die for the next size. The die size order is d4 -> d6 -> d8 -> d10 -> d12
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 2
     ========================================================= -->

{{level

**Mana and Tier 1 Spells.** You unlock Tier 1 Greenspeaker spells and a mana pool to cast them. Max mana is always equal to WIL+LVL, and recharges on a Safe Rest.
:
**Savage Bloom.** When you deal damage with a spell, you may expend a Seed Die. If you do, the spell deals an additional WIL d(SD) damage.
:
**Cultivate Flora.** (1/turn) Action: Grow one of your Seed Dice up to two sizes.

}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 3
     Subclass
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Subclass**. Choose a Greenspeaker subclass.
:
**One With the Grove.** Advantage on Naturecraft checks related to flora. You can communicate simple thoughts with plants and make basic requests of them

}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 4
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Horticulture.** Choose 1 Horticulture ability. 
:
**Tier 2 Spells.** You may now cast tier 2 Greenspeaker spells.
:
**Key Stat Increase**. +1 WIL or STR.
}}


{{note,wide
**Commune.** You may choose different Greenspeaker options whenever you tend to plants or meditate in a natural space during a Safe Rest.
}}


{{pageNumber}}

\page

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 5
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Turning of the Seasons.** Choose 2 Seasonal Adaptations. When you roll Inititative, choose a Seasonal Adaptation you know to be active for the encounter.
:
**Seed Dice (2).** Your Seed Dice maximum value is now d10.
:
**Secondary Stat Increase**. +1 DEX or INT.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 6
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Tier 3 Spells.** You may now cast tier 3 Greenspeaker spells.
:
**Bark Skin.** When you Defend, you may expend a Seed Die to increase your Defense by STR×2 until the start of your next turn.
:
**Horticulture (2).** Choose a 2nd Horticulture ability. 
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 7
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Subclass**. Gain your Greenspeaker subclass feature.

}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 8
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Tier 4 Spells.** You may now cast tier 4 Greenspeaker spells.
:
**Key Stat Increase**. +1 WIL or STR.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 9
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Horticulture (3).** Choose a 3rd Horticulture ability. 
:
**Secondary Stat Increase**. +1 DEX or INT.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 10
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Tier 5 Spells.** You may now cast tier 5 Greenspeaker spells.
:
**Seed Dice (3).** Your Seed Dice maximum value is now d12. 
:
**Turning of the Seasons (2).** Choose a 3rd Seasonal Adaptation.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 11
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Subclass**. Gain your Greenspeaker subclass feature.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 12
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Horticulture (4).** Choose a 4th Horticulture ability. 
:
**Key Stat Increase**. +1 WIL or STR.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 13
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Root Stride.** When you Cultivate Growth, move up to half your Speed for free.
:
**Secondary Stat Increase**. +1 DEX or INT.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 14
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Turning of the Seasons (3).** Choose a 4th Seasonal Adaptation.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 15
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Subclass**. Gain your Greenspeaker subclass feature.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 16
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Horticulture (4).** Choose a 4th Horticulture ability.
:
**Key Stat Increase**. +1 WIL or STR.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 17
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Bark Skin (2).** Your Bark Skin' Defense bonus increases to STRx3. 
:
**Secondary Stat Increase**. +1 DEX or INT.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 18
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Shifting Seasons.** (1/encounter) At the start of your turn, you may switch to a different Seasonal Adaptation than your current one.


}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 19
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Epic Boon**. Choose an Epic Boon (see pg. 23 of the GM's Guide).
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 20
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Ancient Fury.** +1 to any 2 of your stats. When you expend a Seed Die for Savage Bloom, you may expend a second Seed Die of the same size to double Savage Bloom's damage bonus.
}}

